WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.864
Long, long ago, floods kept sweeping across the land.

00:00:04.214 --> 00:00:08.462
Villages were surrounded by water, and life was very hard for the people.

00:00:08.812 --> 00:00:13.588
The leader entrusted the task of controlling the floods to Gun.

00:00:13.938 --> 00:00:17.970
Full of confidence, Gun decided to block the floods with levees.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:23.096
People carried in earth and stones, working day and night without rest.

00:00:23.446 --> 00:00:26.830
Day by day, the tall levees rose higher and higher.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:30.900
But the floods grew stronger and burst through the levees.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:35.450
Fields and houses were swallowed by the waters once again.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:40.312
Gun worked hard for many years, but still did not succeed.

00:00:40.662 --> 00:00:44.742
Gazing at the surging floodwaters, his heart was heavy with sorrow.

00:00:45.092 --> 00:00:49.004
Later, his son Yu the Great took up the task of controlling the floods.

00:00:49.354 --> 00:00:55.138
Yu changed the method, deciding to dredge the river channels and let the floodwaters flow to the sea.

